{
  "info": {
    "name": "School Assessment API",
    "description": "Teachers, classes and students API (NestJS).\n\n1. Import `school-assessment.postman_environment.json` as well and fill in the seed passwords from your `.env` (`SEED_*_PASSWORD`).\n2. Run one of the **Auth → Login as …** requests; the token is saved automatically.\n3. Create requests save the new id (`userId`, `teacherId`, `classId`, `studentId`) so the following requests use it.\n\nRoles: read = any logged-in user; create/update = ADMIN, OPERATOR; delete, register, import = ADMIN.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "currentUserId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "teacherUserId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "teacherId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "classId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "studentId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('currentUserId', body.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Logs in and stores the JWT in `accessToken`; every other request uses it. Limited to 5 attempts per IP per minute.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
